<title>UK: Copamex Industrias sets $200 mln 7-year bond.</title>
<headline>Copamex Industrias sets $200 mln 7-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Citibank International Plc.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COPAMEX INDUSTRIAS SA DE CV</p>
<p> AMT   $200 MLN	 COUPON     **	  MATURITY  * 06.MAY.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    06.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  **	  REOFFER    **	  SPREAD **+437.5-450</p>
<p>BP  NOTES    **TO BE PRICED LATER</p>
<p>	     *CALLABLE 06.MAY.02 AND 06.MAY.03</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K)  ONE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  MEXICO    SALE LIMITS US/UK/MX</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5.875 PCT FEB.04 U.S TREASURY -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
